## Lane Discipline

This project uses lane-isolated development. **Cross-stack rule:** if a task touches more than one lane, STOP and split into separate tasks/PRs.

| Lane | Scope | Role |
|------|-------|------|
<% if (_lanes.includes('frontend')) { %>| **frontend** | `frontend/` | UI — components, styles, client logic |
<% } %><% if (_lanes.includes('backend')) { %>| **backend** | `backend/` | Server — APIs, domain, persistence |
<% } %><% if (_lanes.includes('docs')) { %>| **docs** | `docs/` | Documentation (READ-ONLY src, WRITE-ONLY docs) |
<% } %>
**Single-lane task**: identify lane, run lane gate, PR touches only that lane's files.
**Cross-lane task**: STOP → split into N single-lane PRs, one per affected lane.
<% } } -%>

